SUMMARY:The Metropolitan Opera: Macbeth (VF)
DESCRIPTION:The Metropolitan Opera: Macbeth\n(1.0)\n\n𝟯𝗵𝟯𝟬\n\nU
 S\n(Italian\, English)\n𝗗𝗮𝘁𝗲 𝗱𝗲 𝘀𝗼𝗿𝘁𝗶𝗲
  : 17 octobre 2026\n\n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀 : L
 ouisa Proske\, Gary Halvorson\n𝗦𝗰𝗲𝗻𝗮𝗿𝗶𝗼 : Francesc
 o Maria Piave\, Andrea Maffei\n\n𝗔𝗰𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀 :\n- Lise Da
 vidsen\n- Quinn Kelsey\n- Jonathan Burton\n- Freddie De Tommaso\n- Ryan Sp
 eedo Green\n- Anthony Roth Costanzo\n\n\n(synopsis non encore traduit sur 
 TMDB)\nTwo of opera’s most extraordinary artists return to The Met: Live
  in HD for Verdi’s thrilling take on the immortal Shakespearean tale of 
 the scheming couple determined to seize power at any cost. Following past 
 triumphs in many of Verdi’s signature baritone roles\, Quinn Kelsey is t
 he Scottish king haunted by the ghosts of his murderous ascent to the thro
 ne\, opposite Lise Davidsen—the world’s reigning dramatic soprano—as
  the power-mad Lady Macbeth\, whose ruinous ambition damns them both. Met 
 Music Director Yannick Nézet-Séguin takes the podium for a penetrating p
 roduction by Louisa Proske\, a brilliant young director making waves aroun
 d the world. Rounding out the all-star cast are tenor Freddie De Tommaso a
 s the heroic Macduff and bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green as Macbeth’s fr
 iend-turned-victim Banquo. This live cinema transmission is part of The Me
 t: Live in HD series\, bringing opera to movie theaters across the globe.\
 n\n\nAffiche : https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Z1rpLnrxn8LAMtDZKCfYlcPeYa
 .jpg\n\nFiche TMDB : https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1703622\n\nDonnées 
 fournies par The Movie Database (TMDB)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
